<title>USA: TABLE - Terex Q2 oper net profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Terex Q2 oper net profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>WESTPORT, Conn. 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.48     loss	 $0.26</p>
<p> Net profit		 7,300     loss	 3,600</p>
<p> Revs		     232,200		  182,800</p>
<p>			SIX MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.72     loss	 $0.66</p>
<p> Net profit		10,800     loss	 8,200</p>
<p> Revs		     408,500		  356,000</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: Net and per-share figures given are for operating income. Net income per share figures not provided. For Q2 1997, net income was profit $4.7 million, including $2.6 million refinancing charge, vs profit $2.6 million for the year-ago period. For the six months, net income was profit $8.2 million vs profit $1.2 million.</p>
<p>Average weighted shares outstanding were 15.2 million for the second quarter of 1997 and 14.9 million for the six-month period.</p>
<p>Full name of company is Terex Corp.</p>
